ga0h(){return"Tap a card to open the damage dialog. Damage changes in 10/50/100 steps, matching the real 10/50/100-point damage counters. Drag a card to swap it between the bench and the active spot (its marker follows the same Pok\xe9mon). The small icon in a card's top-right corner resets just that card's damage. The small dot in a card's bottom-left corner is a manual reminder for whether that Pok\xe9mon's ability has been used \u2014 tap it to switch between gray (unused) and red (used). It isn't reset automatically, so toggle it yourself whenever fits your situation."},
ga0k(){return"Header buttons"},
